#: index.docbook:49
msgid	"&kicker; applets"
msgstr	"&kicker; miniprogramme"

#: index.docbook:51
msgid	"Applets are small applications running inside of &kicker;. Almost "
	"everything besides the application starter buttons are applets. They "
	"can be added from the <guimenu>context</guimenu> menu or from the "
	"submenu <guisubmenu>Configure Panel</guisubmenu> by choosing "
	"<guisubmenu>Add</guisubmenu> and the "
	"<guimenuitem>Applet</guimenuitem>."
msgstr	"Miniprogramme is klein programmetjies wat binne in &kicker; loop."
	"Omtrent alles behalwe die 'begin' knoppie is miniprogramme.  Hulle "
	"kan bygevoeg word vanuit die <guimenu>konteks</guimenu> kieskaart opsie "
	"of deur <guisubmenu>Add</guisubmenu> -&gt; <guimenuitem>Miniprogram"
	"</guimenuitem> uit die subkieskaart <guisubmenu>Konfigurasie Paneel"
	"</guisubmenu> te kies."

#: index.docbook:59
msgid	"More information on the use of &kicker; and on the base set of "
	"applets that come with &kicker;, can be found in the &kicker; "
	"handbook."
msgstr	"Die &kicker; handleiding bevat meer inligting oor die gebruik "
	"van &kicker; en oor die basiese stel miniprogramme wat saam "
	"met &kicker; kom."

